# param2reg.py
a tool to parsing 1880v2_API_parameters_to_registers_mapping_list.xlsx
and generate source codes.
if you have any question, please contact with kidd (kidd.chen@wisecore.com.tw).

you might use `pip -r requirements.txt` to install dependant libraries.


